[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative\nterminal.</p><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752827\">4450B06</a></p><p>Or</p><p><a href=\"#/2752828\">4450B08</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the ABS wheel sensor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K76</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K75</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Release the rpm sensor electrical cable from the brackets on\nthe rear axle.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046705.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt securing the rear wheel rpm sensor.</p><p>2. Remove the rear rpm sensor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046706.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the wheel rpm sensor, positioning\nthe wiring correctly.</p><p>Connect the electrical connector.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Right rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K76</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Left rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>K75</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Screw in the rpm sensor bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ABS REAR WHEEL RPM SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752827\">4450B06</a></p><p>Or.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752828\">4450B08</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]